@startuml
title Searching equipment by name or model
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
participant ":LabLog" as App
participant ":EquipmentSearchCommands" as Search
participant ":Inventory" as Inventory
participant ":LoanBook" as Loans
participant ":FaultBook" as Faults

[-> App : search scope
activate App
App -> Search : execute(input)
activate Search
note right of Search
Validate phrase and normalize
case and whitespace.
end note
Search -> Inventory : getEquipmentUnits()
activate Inventory
Inventory --> Search : ordered equipment snapshot
deactivate Inventory
note right of Search
Filter by name or model.
Preserve snapshot order.
end note
loop Each matching unit
    Search -> Loans : hasLostLoan(assetId)
    activate Loans
    Loans --> Search : lost status
    deactivate Loans
    opt No lost loan
        Search -> Loans : hasActiveLoan(assetId)
        activate Loans
        Loans --> Search : active loan status
        deactivate Loans
    end
    opt No lost or active loan
        Search -> Faults : blocksLending(assetId)
        activate Faults
        Faults --> Search : severe fault status
        deactivate Faults
    end
    note right of Search
Format this unit's row
with its availability.
    end note
end
Search --> App : formatted result
deactivate Search
App -->[ : display result
deactivate App
legend bottom
Matching-equipment path shown; empty inventories and no matches return a message.
Search reads shared session books without changing records or saving data.
endlegend
@enduml
